---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Nucleosynthesis Cheat Sheet | Free Big Bang, Stellar, r-process"
  description="Complete nucleosynthesis cheat sheet with Big Bang, stellar, and r-process. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Nucleosynthesis<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Big Bang, stellar, and r-process. From hydrogen to heavy elements.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Big Bang Nucleosynthesis</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>BBN Process</h3>
        <pre><code>t ~ 1 s: neutron-proton freeze-out
t ~ 3 min: deuterium forms
t ~ 20 min: helium forms
t ~ 1 hour: nucleosynthesis ends
Products: H (75%), He (25%), traces of Li, D</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Prediction Success</h3>
        <pre><code>He abundance: 24.8% (observed: 25%)
D/H ratio: ~ 2.5 × 10⁻⁵ (observed: 2-3 × 10⁻⁵)
⁷Li/H ratio: ~ 5 × 10⁻¹⁰ (lithium problem)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Stellar Nucleosynthesis</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Fusion Chains</h3>
        <pre><code>pp chain: 4H → He (stars < 1.3 M_sun)
CNO cycle: 4H → He (catalysed by C,N,O)
Triple-alpha: 3He → C
Alpha process: C → O → Ne → Mg → ...
Silicon burning: Si → Fe (end of fusion line)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Beyond Iron</h3>
        <pre><code>Iron peak: most stable nucleus (Fe-56)
Neutron capture: s-process (slow), r-process (rapid)
s-process: AGB stars, steady neutron flux
r-process: supernovae, neutron star mergers
p-process: proton-rich nuclei</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Element Origins</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Origin Table</h3>
        <table>
          <tr><th>Elements</th><th>Origin</th></tr>
          <tr><td>H, He</td><td>Big Bang</td></tr>
          <tr><td>C, N, O</td><td>Stellar fusion</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Fe</td><td>Iron peak (fusion)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Eu, Ba, La</td><td>s-process (AGB stars)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>U, Th, Pt, Au</td><td>r-process (mergers)</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
